Type: added

Heatmap: add `columnGroups` for labelled, gapped column runs and a `buildMonthCalendarHeatmapData` / `useMonthCalendarHeatmapData` layout that draws a date-keyed map as one month calendar per month sharing a single scale. The column-label row is now omitted when no column has a label, the grid takes an `aria-label`, keyboard selection scrolls into view, and calendar labels stay Gregorian under any locale.
